# Container for the trusted domain objects (TDOs) of IPA-to-IPA trusts,
# cn=<domain>,cn=ipa,cn=trusts,$SUFFIX, see
# ipaserver/plugins/ipa_trust_kdb.py and
# ipaserver/plugins/trust.py (make_trust_dn, trust_type 'ipa').
#
# The sibling cn=ad,cn=trusts container holding the Active Directory
# trust TDOs is created by ipa-adtrust-install because it belongs to
# the Samba/AD trust machinery; the IPA container is needed on every
# deployment, so it is created at install/upgrade time like the rest
# of the trust infrastructure (cn=trusts, cn=trust bootstrap).
dn: cn=ipa,cn=trusts,$SUFFIX
default: objectClass: top
default: objectClass: nsContainer
default: cn: ipa
